    "title": "discovery+ | Stream TV Shows",
    "description": "discovery+ is the streaming home of Food, Home, Travel, True Crime, Paranormal and so much more. Watch exciting, can\u2019t miss Original series plus all your favorite shows from the best TV brands. There's something for everyone.\r\n\r\nHere's what discovery+ offers you:\r\n\u2022 Enjoy all your favorites from the best TV brands including: HGTV, Food Network, TLC, ID, DMAX, Magnolia, Animal Planet, Travel Channel, Discovery Channel and more. Channel availability varies by region.\r\n\u2022 Live sport action*\r\n\u2022 Must-see 90 Day Fianc\u00e9 series and other incredible reality moments.\r\n\u2022 Award-winning collection of the best natural history series and breath-taking documentaries.\r\n\u2022 An ever-growing catalog of new TV series and episodes.\r\n\u2022 Full access to watch anytime, anywhere across compatible devices. (Please visit our Help Center for list of compatible devices)**\r\n\u2022 Browse or search with ease across the best in: True Crime, Paranormal & Unexplained, Relationships, Reality, Home, Sports*, Adventure & Exploration, Food, Documentaries, Lifestyle, Nature & Animals, Science & Technology, and Automotive.\r\n\u2022 Cast from your mobile or tablet device to the big screen with Chromecast and Airplay.\r\n\u2022 Download your discovery+ favorites so you can watch on-the-go (only available to Ad-Free subscribers in the US & Brazil).\r\n\u2022 Jump back into your favorite show with Continue Watching or save an episode to watch later with My List.\r\n\r\nContent, TV brands, functionality & features shown vary by region and may not be available in your country.\r\n\r\n*Live sports only available in select countries.\r\n**Internet required \r\n\r\nTo learn more, visit our privacy notices here: https://corporate.discovery.com/discoveryplus/legal/privacy/\r\n\r\nCookies & Tracking Technologies Notice: corporate.discovery.com/discoveryplus/legal/cookies-and-tracking-technologies-notice/\r\n\r\nFor help in the U.S and Canada, please visit our Help Center:  help.discoveryplus.com\r\nFor help in all other regions, please visit our Help Center: https://support.discoveryplus.com/\r\n\r\nFor Terms of Use in Brazil, please visit: https://www.discoveryplus.com/br/contrato-de-assinatura\r\nFor Terms of Use in India, please visit: https://www.discoveryplus.in/terms-of-use\r\nFor Terms of Use in all other regions, please visit: https://corporate.discovery.com/discoveryplus/legal/terms-of-use",
    "descriptionHTML": "discovery+ is the streaming home of Food, Home, Travel, True Crime, Paranormal and so much more. Watch exciting, can\u2019t miss Original series plus all your favorite shows from the best TV brands. There&#39;s something for everyone.<br><br>Here&#39;s what discovery+ offers you:<br>\u2022 Enjoy all your favorites from the best TV brands including: HGTV, Food Network, TLC, ID, DMAX, Magnolia, Animal Planet, Travel Channel, Discovery Channel and more. Channel availability varies by region.<br>\u2022 Live sport action*<br>\u2022 Must-see 90 Day Fianc\u00e9 series and other incredible reality moments.<br>\u2022 Award-winning collection of the best natural history series and breath-taking documentaries.<br>\u2022 An ever-growing catalog of new TV series and episodes.<br>\u2022 Full access to watch anytime, anywhere across compatible devices. (Please visit our Help Center for list of compatible devices)**<br>\u2022 Browse or search with ease across the best in: True Crime, Paranormal &amp; Unexplained, Relationships, Reality, Home, Sports*, Adventure &amp; Exploration, Food, Documentaries, Lifestyle, Nature &amp; Animals, Science &amp; Technology, and Automotive.<br>\u2022 Cast from your mobile or tablet device to the big screen with Chromecast and Airplay.<br>\u2022 Download your discovery+ favorites so you can watch on-the-go (only available to Ad-Free subscribers in the US &amp; Brazil).<br>\u2022 Jump back into your favorite show with Continue Watching or save an episode to watch later with My List.<br><br>Content, TV brands, functionality &amp; features shown vary by region and may not be available in your country.<br><br>*Live sports only available in select countries.<br>**Internet required <br><br>To learn more, visit our privacy notices here: https://corporate.discovery.com/discoveryplus/legal/privacy/<br><br>Cookies &amp; Tracking Technologies Notice: corporate.discovery.com/discoveryplus/legal/cookies-and-tracking-technologies-notice/<b